@startuml Sum_Ssfm_LinResponder_MissingMsg_SeqDiag

control Scheduler as Sche 
participant Dem as Dem
participant SUSD as SUSD
participant Com as Com
participant RTE as RTE
box SUM_SSFM
    participant Sum_Ssfm_FIM_ReceivedSerialData_Handler as Rec
    participant Sum_Ssfm_MessageInfo_Handler as MessageInfo
    participant Sum_Ssfm_Errh_EventDebouncer_Manager as Deb
    participant Sum_Ssfm_LinResponder_Error_Manager as MMsg
end box
participant LNM as LNM

group Callback handling of each associated serial data of configured <Lin_Responder>
activate RTE
alt receive serial data
    Com-> RTE: Rte_ComCbk
    activate Rec
    Rec -> RTE: Read the SerialData data from the RTE
    RTE-->Rec
    activate MMsg
    Rec->MMsg:Sum_Ssfm_LINResponder_CbkRxRec_Handler()
        alt All LIN signals related to <Lin_Responder> which status are SUM_SSFM_SigSts_Supervision_Received
            MMsg->LNM: Set interface NodeTimeout to LNM as DTC INACTIVE
        end    
    deactivate Rec
else timeout    
    Com-> RTE: Rte_ComCbkTOut
    activate MessageInfo
    RTE->MessageInfo: Com_CbkRxTOut
    MessageInfo->MMsg:Sum_Ssfm_LINResponder_CbkRxTOut_Handler()
    MMsg->LNM: Set interface NodeTimeout to LNM as DTC ACTIVE
    deactivate MessageInfo
end    
deactivate RTE
end

group Runnable_SSFM_LNM_<Lin_Responder>_MissingMsg_Changed
LNM -> MMsg: Data event LNM_ERRH_NodeStatusIdx changed
MMsg -> SUSD: Ask for battery voltage range
SUSD --> MMsg
alt (No OBD Support and voltage in range) or (OBD Support and not under voltage)
    MMsg -> MMsg: Set Sum_Ssfm_LNMError_MissingMsg_TestEnableFlag <Lin_Responder>
end
end
Sche->MMsg: Scheduling Event
group Periodicity runnable monitor for the test enable criteria flag and debouncing time.
MMsg->MMsg: Runnable_SSFM_Execution_LNMError_MissingMessage()
activate Deb
MMsg->Deb: Perform debouncing, calling Sum_Ssfm_ErrhDebouncerExecution()
Deb-->MMsg:
deactivate Deb
MMsg -> Dem: Set/Reset related Dem events based on debouncing result
end 
deactivate MMsg

@enduml 